{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39687","headline":"寄罗浮山道者二首 二 · 黄滔","name":"寄罗浮山道者二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有人曾见洞中仙，才到人间便越年。\n金鼎药成龙入海，玉函书发鹤归天。\n楼开石脉千寻直，山拆鳌鳞一半膻。\n谁到月明朝礼处，翠岩深锁荔枝烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39687.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39687","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}